OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy today with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, turning increasingly heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. Winds strengthening through the
OL,8,Fmorning and into the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling more humid later today.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FFurther outbreaks of rain are
OL,12,Flikely this evening and tonight,
OL,13,Fsometimes heavy. Gradually turning
OL,14,Fdrier from the north in the early
OL,15,Fhours perhaps with some clear spells.
OL,16,FWinds easing. Muggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
