OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy start with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some heavy. Drier
OL,7,Fand brighter by the afternoon across
OL,8,FNorth and mid-Wales, but likely
OL,9,Fremaining cloudy in the south. Lighter
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FRemaining changeable over the next few
OL,14,Fdays, with spells of rain or showers
OL,15,Fat times, and feeling increasingly
OL,16,Ffresh. Turning windy as spells of rain
OL,17,Fmove through.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
